    "Node names are normalized labels (lowercase, hyphens as spaces, '&' spelled).",
    "Edit freely: similarity between two genres is decay^(shortest path length),",
    "so adding an edge makes two genres one step closer. Unknown labels fall back",
    "to lexical similarity."
